  "body": "**What.** The laptop's octo-double build of hp is done (exit 0, 45 min, LTO off). Its step 3 runs the bit-identity checks, `ojet_check.py` and a release step at D 79.77.\n\n**Why.** Digest, \"In flight right now\". The commands and expected exits are the 2026-11-07 16:21 UTC entry of [comms.txt](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms.txt). The laptop needs this build before T152.\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- `highm_check.py ref`, `scaled` and `jets` exit 0, and the control `jets --mutate=kappa` exits 1.\n- `ojet_check.py` exits 0, with `d_oq` equal by order to `od-mac/ojet_T113_D148.jsonl` (largest relative difference 0).\n- `full_release.py` prints first, od and on 0 lines equal to `T141-win2/release_D79.7657.log` apart from timings (dDelta +5.03e-08).\n- Any mismatch is reported as a discrepancy, and T152 is held until it is explained.\n- Raw output goes to a task folder of the raw-data repository (AGENTS.md), and `python3 raw_check.py <folder> PATTERN` passes on it.\n\n**Files.** [hp/highm_check.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/hp/highm_check.py), [hp/ojet_check.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/hp/ojet_check.py), [hp/full_release.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/hp/full_release.py), [notes/OCTO_DOUBLE.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/notes/OCTO_DOUBLE.md)",
