   "body": "Results (win laptop, posted by the coordinator from win's comms entry of 2026-11-07 20:37 UTC; its gh write was blocked by its permission classifier).\n\nThe octo-double build (main, multidouble 4.0.0, avx512, LTO off) passes every check:\n\n| step | result |\n|---|---|\n| build | exit 0, 45 min, peak working sets 15.8 GB |\n| highm_check ref, scaled, jets | exit 0, 0, 0 |\n| jets --mutate=kappa (control) | exit 1, as required |\n| ojet_check T113 D 148.74 | exit 0; d_oq, d_qa, d_dq, d_oq1 and norms_o equal od-mac's (largest relative difference 0) |\n| full_release D 79.7657 --octo 1 --junk 4 --it 1 | first, od and on 0 lines equal T141-win2's; dDelta +5.03e-08 |\n\nRaw: `T151-win/` at bb55855; raw_check.py passes. The laptop can run octo-double work (T152).",
